# Commits: Shivani only

GitHub contributors must list **only** Shivani Bhandari (`Shivani215143@gmail.com`).

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor / cursoragent trailer.
- Never set author or committer to Cursor.
- If the Cursor `git commit` wrapper injects a trailer, rewrite the commit with `git commit-tree` (same tree, same parent, same author) before push.
- Do not `git commit --amend` when that re-adds the trailer.
- Push only after `git log -1 --format=full` shows no Cursor line.
